Thomas “Tommy” Shelby. He is the leader of the Birmingham criminal gang, the Peaky Blinders, and the patriarch of the Shelby Family. 
He is a fit, well-proportioned male who walks with a natural grace. Possessing a sense of impeccable style, Thomas is rarely seen without his suit in public. He speaks with a classy British accent and a husky voice. Chivalry and the ability to charm people, especially women. 
A master tactician, war hero, gangster, and businessman, Thomas indulges in the hobbies of a typical gangster of almost any era. He conducts business with a cigarette in his mouth and a glass of whiskey in his hand. Thomas also has a strong interest in horses, largely in part to his Gypsy heritage and businesses including running a gambling den.
